sequenceDiagram
    title UC17 用户主页与关注关系——对象级顺序图
    participant P0 as 用户
    participant P1 as UserProfile.vue
    participant P2 as UserProfile/FollowController
    participant P3 as FollowServiceImpl
    participant P4 as UserMapper/FollowMapper
    participant P5 as NotificationCenterService
    P0->>P1: 查看主页或切换关注
    P1->>P2: GET profile；POST /api/follow/{userId}
    P2->>P3: toggleFollow(follower,followee)
    P3->>P4: 校验用户并幂等更新关系
    P4-->>P3: 返回关注状态
    P3->>P5: 关注成功时通知对方
    P5->>P3: 通知失败不回滚关系
    P3-->>P2: 返回主页和关系状态
    Note over P0,P5: 禁止关注自己；主页响应不得暴露密码、手机号等非公开字段。
